{
    "title": "SportsEngine \u2013 Team Management",
    "description": "Team management apps just got better with SportsEngine. From little league and club sports to amateur team sports and beyond, SportsEngine is the only sports team management app you\u2019ll ever need. Coaches, parents, and families can stay updated on team games, rosters, and game statistics all through the app. Check your team\u2019s sports calendar, connect through team chat, and RSVP for matches with SportsEngine\u2019s convenient features. Best of all, our sports team app is completely free to use, bringing you the tools you need to take your team to the next level without the extra cost.\r\n\r\nSkip the complex team manager apps. Team management is already stressful enough, and you need a coaching app that can simplify organizing so you can focus on the important team games ahead.\r\n\r\nUse our helpful sports statistics feature to make better decisions on gameday. View your sports calendar and roster, schedule team games, connect via team chat, and more. Get everything you would expect from a team manager app plus more with SportsEngine.\r\n\r\nOur team app will have you saying goodbye to last-second emails and phone calls. Access your latest team sports schedule and track player availability right on SportsEngine. Manage any team from competitive sports clubs to little league teams. Ensure athletes and families show up to team games at the right place and on time with the help of SportsEngine\u2019s teams app. \r\n\r\nOur sports team app is for parents and fans, too. Check the team\u2019s latest schedule, view cancellations and changes, RSVP for events, share photos and more. SportsEngine is the perfect team app for staying in the loop with your favorite teams and sports clubs.\r\n\r\nOur team manager app is your end-to-end solution for everything sports related. Whether you\u2019re a football, baseball, soccer, or hockey manager, let the SportsEngine team management app do the work for you. Download SportsEngine today and simplify how you manage your teams and stay connected.\r\n\r\nSPORTSENGINE FEATURES:\r\n\r\nFOR TEAM MANAGERS & COACHES:\r\n- Team Management at All Levels: From little league, amateur team sports, and more, SportsEngine is the perfect coaching app\r\n- Sports Roster: Create and manage team rosters with ease\r\n- Sports Schedule: Schedule changes or updates to team games, practices, and events\r\n- Team Chat: Communicate with athletes, parents, and families\r\n- Sports Stats: Build a competitive team by checking your team\u2019s sports statistics\r\n- Score games quickly and conveniently through our team app\r\n\r\nFOR TEAMS, PARENTS & FAMILIES\r\n- Stay Updated: Check team games and view events for multiple athletes on one sports calendar\r\n- Scheduling Convenience: Your sports schedule can be integrated with your personal calendar\r\n- Alerts: Get notifications of team activity and schedule changes\r\n- RSVP: Confirm availability for team games, practices, and events\r\n- Stay Connected: Team chat for families, athletes, and coaches makes it easy to communicate\r\n- Capture Moments: Our team app lets you share photos with ease\r\n\r\nFEATURES FOR ORGANIZATIONS USING SPORTSENGINE HQ\r\nYouth sports organizations on the SportsEngine HQ platform unlock these additional features on the SportsEngine sports team management app:\r\n- Sports Stats\r\n- Standings\r\n- Email messaging\r\n- News articles\r\n\r\nLearn more about SportsEngine HQ\r\n\r\nThe teams app made to make your life easier. Manage team games, events and athlete communication on SportsEngine.\r\n\r\nABOUT SPORTSENGINE\r\nSportsEngine is the Home of Youth Sports and the leading provider of Sport Relationship Management (SRM) software and sports team management apps serving millions of coaches, parents, athletes, clubs, leagues, governing bodies, and associations.\r\n\r\nHaving trouble? Reach us at semobile@sportsengine.com\r\n\r\nLEARN MORE:\r\nwww.sportsengine.com/mobile\r\n\r\nSPORTSENGINE TERMS OF USE:\r\nhttps://www.sportsengine.com/terms-of-use\r\n\r\nSPORTSENGINE PRIVACY POLICY:\r\nhttps://www.nbcuniversal.com/privacy?intake=SportsEngine",
